icate medication order", "detail": "Cisplatin 50 MG and PACLitaxel 100 MG are recorded repeatedly on consecutive days with start and stop times identical and no dose/route details; this may be duplicate or incomplete order data and is atypical for cisplatin administration."}]}, "metrics": {"conflict_f1": 0.0, "false_positives": 1, "score": 0.0}}
